# GallosOS whitelisted application menu (read by /usr/bin/gallos-menu).
# Format: Label|command [args]
# Entries whose command is not installed on the image are hidden
# automatically, so this list can describe every supported .gsm module.
Terminal|gallos-terminal
Code Editor (default)|gallos-launch editor
VSCodium|codium
Geany|geany
CLion|clion
IntelliJ IDEA|idea
PyCharm|pycharm
Kate|kate
Code::Blocks|codeblocks
Neovim|gallos-terminal -e nvim
Vim|gallos-terminal -e vim
Browser / Judge|gallos-launch browser
Offline Documentation|gallos-launch docs
Run Source File...|gallos-run --pick
Keyboard Shortcuts|gallos-hotkeys
Power...|gallos-power
